  "details": "It would be nice to have additional information for a user or users about to be kicked. Information such as the rank, the avatar, bio, etc. \n\nSometimes a name is not enough, and trolls will use this to their advantage by using the vote kick system themselves and cause innocent users to be kicked in the confusion.\n\nA very popular request is to also add a reason for the kick, so I will not go too far into that. I have seen another with a neat idea to highlight a username in red that is in the process of being vote kicked, making it easier to spot which user or users that need to be dealt with and avoid accidental vote kicking.",
